    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Multiple active price rules whose actions target the same field on the same object.
Why it matters: Order-dependent — small changes in evaluation order silently shift prices. Hard to audit; common source of mystery price changes after admin work.
Suppress a finding: when the layering is documented and intentional.
Disable the detector: most should leave this on.</value></values>
